WEBVTT

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:01.835
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:07.007
In order to participate in Love Live this
time, we began working on a new song.

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:10.468
But with so little time to write a song,
everyone was feeling the pressure.

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:15.932
We attempted to overcome it
by helping each other.

00:00:15.932 --> 00:00:19.686
No matter what, songs
are always for everyone.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.480
If someone stops, someone
else will pull them along.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.567
The most important thing is how you feel.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:28.278
And so, we finally completed our new song.

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:30.071
Aim for Victory at Love Live!
The preliminaries are finally about to start.

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:31.489
One, two, three, four...

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:32.991
Five, six, seven, eight...

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:36.661
This is the official Love Live website.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:39.831
What's this?

00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:42.500
They're the local stages where
the preliminaries will be held.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:48.506
Because so many groups are participating
this time, there are more places to perform.

00:00:48.506 --> 00:00:49.799
What!? Really!?

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:52.427
It's in the rule book.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.137
Why didn't you know?

00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:57.599
I'm not so good at reading.

00:00:57.599 --> 00:01:02.437
Should we choose the location of our
performance ourselves, it'll be streamed live.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:05.815
Everyone in the country
will be able to watch us.

00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:08.234
Nationwide...

00:01:08.943 --> 00:01:10.445
That's amazing!

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:24.042
It's starting.

00:01:24.042 --> 00:01:30.256
Saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:37.847
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:01:44.896 --> 00:01:50.235
Tsuyoi tsuyoi negaigoto ga
A strong, strong wish

00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:55.782
bokutachi wo michibiite kureta
Led us along

00:01:55.782 --> 00:02:00.870
tsugi wa zettai yuzurenaiyo
We can't give up the next one

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:06.000
nokosareta jikan wo nigirishimete We'll hold
on tightly to the time we have remaining

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:11.506
tada no omoide sore dake ja iyadayo
We don't want only a memory

00:02:11.506 --> 00:02:17.345
seiippai chikara no kagiri hashirunda
We'll run as hard as we can

00:02:17.345 --> 00:02:20.181
(CHANCE FOR ME CHANCE FOR YOU)
(Chance for me! Chance for you!)

00:02:20.181 --> 00:02:25.812
Saa yume wo dakishimetara ue wo muite
Come on... Embrace your dreams and look up

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:30.608
kimi no sekai ga ohkiku kawaruyo
Your world will change dramatically

00:02:30.608 --> 00:02:36.740
saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:41.786
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:02:41.786 --> 00:02:47.125
Ima koko de deaeta kiseki
The miracle that we met here and now

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:53.840
wasurenaide bokutachi no kisetsu
Don't forget our season

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.886
Each group has five minutes to perform.

00:02:57.886 --> 00:03:02.557
#3 - Door of Dreams They must
begin when it is their time to perform.

00:03:02.891 --> 00:03:05.143
They'll be streamed nationwide from here.

00:03:05.143 --> 00:03:08.521
The audience will be able to
vote for their favorite groups.

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:09.981
That's how we'll be ranked.

00:03:09.981 --> 00:03:14.194
Then the top four groups advance
to the final preliminaries.

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:16.571
The top four... It won't be easy to get in.

00:03:16.571 --> 00:03:20.200
And Tokyo will be the
most competitive region.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.911
And on top of that...

00:03:23.495 --> 00:03:24.621
Hello!

00:03:25.163 --> 00:03:26.748
I'm Yuki Anju!

00:03:27.081 --> 00:03:28.374
I'm Todo Erena!

00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:31.336
And I'm the leader, Kira Tsubasa!

00:03:31.503 --> 00:03:35.465
Please watch us at the
Love Live Tokyo preliminary!

00:03:37.801 --> 00:03:38.968
A-RISE...

00:03:38.968 --> 00:03:42.680
That's right. They're already
nationally popular.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:45.433
They're sure to be one of the top four groups.

00:03:45.433 --> 00:03:50.605
What? Does that mean we have to get
into one of the other three spots?

00:03:50.605 --> 00:03:51.773
Yeah.

00:03:51.773 --> 00:03:52.524
What?

00:03:52.524 --> 00:03:54.651
Let's stay positive.

00:03:54.651 --> 00:03:57.111
Three other groups will advance.

00:03:57.111 --> 00:04:01.741
We can perform wherever
we want this time, right?

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:02.617
Yes.

00:04:02.617 --> 00:04:05.620
Then why don't we make
the school our stage?

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:07.789
We won't feel nervous here.

00:04:07.789 --> 00:04:10.792
We'll be able to put on our kind of concert.

00:04:10.792 --> 00:04:11.709
Good idea.

00:04:12.794 --> 00:04:13.837
How naive.

00:04:13.837 --> 00:04:14.629
Huh?

00:04:14.629 --> 00:04:16.381
Nico-chan's right.

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:19.175
You only get one shot on a live stream.

00:04:19.175 --> 00:04:20.969
There are no do-overs.

00:04:20.969 --> 00:04:25.265
If we make a mistake,
the whole world will see it!

00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:28.351
Besides, we'll have to
stand out on the screen.

00:04:28.351 --> 00:04:30.395
We'll have to do something unique.

00:04:30.395 --> 00:04:31.354
Unique...

00:04:31.354 --> 00:04:33.064
Like an unconventional song?

00:04:33.064 --> 00:04:33.940
Or costumes?

00:04:34.732 --> 00:04:37.443
Perhaps some sexy costumes?

00:04:38.194 --> 00:04:39.612
I-I can't do that.

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:40.989
Umi-chan.

00:04:40.989 --> 00:04:42.907
It's been a while since this has happened.

00:04:42.907 --> 00:04:46.619
I'd like to see Eli-chi in a sexy dress.

00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:47.328
What?

00:04:48.037 --> 00:04:49.998
Sexual harassment!

00:04:49.998 --> 00:04:52.000
Don't you mean "sexy dynamite"?

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:52.792
I can't.

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:54.127
How long are you gonna keep saying that?

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:56.546
No way! I'm not doing it!

00:04:57.922 --> 00:05:00.341
A sexy dress...

00:05:02.552 --> 00:05:05.638
I'll blow your hearts away!

00:05:05.638 --> 00:05:07.056
Bang!

00:05:07.056 --> 00:05:11.519
- Let go! I don't want to do it!
- No one said we're doing that!

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.980
I'm not doing it, either!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.273
There you go again.

00:05:15.273 --> 00:05:16.774
No one asked you to—

00:05:16.941 --> 00:05:19.152
I'll pinch you.

00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:20.653
You're already pinching me!

00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:24.282
Anyway, if some of us are already
self-conscious about doing it...

00:05:24.782 --> 00:05:26.784
You're right.

00:05:26.784 --> 00:05:29.120
S-Sexy dress...

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:33.124
Don't we have something more
important to do than talking here?

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.710
Like what?

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:37.045
Really!?

00:05:37.045 --> 00:05:40.798
Sure. If you're fine with doing the
lunchtime broadcast, we don't mind.

00:05:40.798 --> 00:05:42.842
She's in the Broadcasting Club.

00:05:43.676 --> 00:05:48.056
If we appeal to the school, they'll support us.

00:05:48.056 --> 00:05:52.518
And, it'll help us practice for the live stream.

00:05:52.518 --> 00:05:54.395
Nice idea, Maki-chan!

00:05:54.395 --> 00:05:57.523
If we make a mistake at school,
it won't bother anyone.

00:05:57.523 --> 00:05:59.275
And, no one else will find out about it.

00:05:59.275 --> 00:06:02.153
Having everyone's support
would be reassuring.

00:06:02.695 --> 00:06:06.074
It's a really good idea, but...

00:06:08.993 --> 00:06:09.953
What's wrong?

00:06:10.453 --> 00:06:14.707
Maki-chan made friends
with someone in her class.

00:06:14.707 --> 00:06:15.583
I'm surprised.

00:06:16.834 --> 00:06:18.419
I-It's not a big deal!

00:06:18.419 --> 00:06:21.798
We just talked when we were
both class officers for the day!

00:06:32.684 --> 00:06:34.936
Hello, everyone!

00:06:39.107 --> 00:06:41.067
Ow!

00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:43.277
What are you doing?

00:06:43.277 --> 00:06:44.821
Um...

00:06:46.072 --> 00:06:47.782
Hello, everyone!

00:06:47.782 --> 00:06:50.743
I'm the student council president. No, wait.

00:06:50.743 --> 00:06:54.038
I'm the leader of u's, Kosaka Honoka.

00:06:54.706 --> 00:06:58.001
But you all know that already.

00:06:58.418 --> 00:07:01.629
We're holding another concert.

00:07:02.839 --> 00:07:06.801
This time, we're trying to
go to Love Live and win.

00:07:07.552 --> 00:07:10.680
And we need your help.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:13.641
Come see our concert.

00:07:14.308 --> 00:07:16.144
We'll do our very best,

00:07:16.602 --> 00:07:18.771
so we hope we'll get your support!

00:07:19.313 --> 00:07:21.149
This has been Kosaka Honoka!

00:07:21.149 --> 00:07:24.068
And now, let me introduce the other—

00:07:24.068 --> 00:07:24.861
Huh?

00:07:26.112 --> 00:07:28.614
Someone rescue me! Someone rescue me!

00:07:29.449 --> 00:07:34.037
Um... I'm playing the role of S-Sonoda Umi.

00:07:34.037 --> 00:07:36.289
My name is Sonoda Umi.

00:07:36.289 --> 00:07:38.041
Why did we choose these three?

00:07:38.041 --> 00:07:42.253
One's the leader, and these
two need the most practice.

00:07:42.253 --> 00:07:46.466
Um... I'm p's member, Koizumi Hanayo.

00:07:47.008 --> 00:07:50.428
Um... My favorite food is rice.

00:07:51.095 --> 00:07:54.390
I don't stand out much among our members.

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:55.933
Raise the volume.

00:07:56.476 --> 00:08:01.272
Uh... I-I'll do my best at the concert.

00:08:01.272 --> 00:08:02.523
Come check it out.

00:08:02.523 --> 00:08:03.775
Hey!

00:08:03.775 --> 00:08:07.028
Speak louder! Louder!

00:08:07.028 --> 00:08:08.488
Oh, sorry.

00:08:09.947 --> 00:08:11.699
All right!

00:08:11.699 --> 00:08:15.036
Anyway... Keep supporting y's!

00:08:16.037 --> 00:08:16.662
Huh?

00:08:25.213 --> 00:08:27.090
What was that? An explosion?

00:08:28.466 --> 00:08:31.135
Jeez! What are you doing?

00:08:31.135 --> 00:08:33.304
It certainly seemed like something
M's would do, though.

00:08:33.304 --> 00:08:34.847
Is that supposed to be a compliment?

00:08:40.895 --> 00:08:42.980
My ears are still ringing.

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:45.733
Did you at least get some practice?

00:08:45.733 --> 00:08:48.569
Yeah. I won't carelessly shout anymore!

00:08:48.569 --> 00:08:50.571
This won't be easy.

00:08:50.571 --> 00:08:52.490
Now we have to choose a location.

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:57.453
As long as they can film it,
we can perform anywhere we want.

00:08:57.453 --> 00:09:00.498
But we already performed
a concert on the roof.

00:09:00.498 --> 00:09:04.502
Oh, right. And we already uploaded it.

00:09:04.502 --> 00:09:05.670
In that case...

00:09:09.549 --> 00:09:11.509
We already performed here.

00:09:13.636 --> 00:09:14.595
And here.

00:09:15.972 --> 00:09:16.931
And here.

00:09:17.515 --> 00:09:19.934
We've already used all these places.

00:09:19.934 --> 00:09:24.564
If we use the same place, we'll
lose some of our uniqueness.

00:09:24.564 --> 00:09:26.190
Yeah.

00:09:28.901 --> 00:09:29.861
But...

00:09:30.987 --> 00:09:33.364
There are so many people here.

00:09:33.865 --> 00:09:37.702
But most importantly,
Akiba is A-RISE territory.

00:09:37.702 --> 00:09:40.872
If we're not careful, they'll think
we're trying to pick a fight.

00:09:41.706 --> 00:09:42.874
Right.

00:09:44.083 --> 00:09:46.836
Welcome to UTX High!

00:09:47.211 --> 00:09:49.088
We finally finished our new song!

00:09:50.631 --> 00:09:54.343
I think this is our most exciting song yet.

00:09:55.636 --> 00:09:57.263
Don't miss it!

00:09:57.763 --> 00:09:59.599
They're amazing.

00:09:59.599 --> 00:10:01.100
They're so bold.

00:10:03.728 --> 00:10:04.729
We won't lose.

00:10:16.157 --> 00:10:17.158
Kosaka-san.

00:10:17.158 --> 00:10:18.367
Huh?

00:10:24.498 --> 00:10:25.833
A-Rl—

00:10:26.542 --> 00:10:27.960
- Come with me.
- What?

00:10:28.419 --> 00:10:30.630
A-RISE is always amazing.

00:10:31.714 --> 00:10:34.717
W-Wait a sec!

00:10:45.728 --> 00:10:46.812
Kayo-chin?

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:49.941
- That was her!
- Tsubasa, right!?

00:11:01.285 --> 00:11:02.286
Nice to meet you.

00:11:03.996 --> 00:11:05.248
Nice to meet you.

00:11:10.294 --> 00:11:11.671
Love Live!

00:11:12.922 --> 00:11:15.591
Welcome to UTX High.

00:11:16.926 --> 00:11:17.885
A-RISE!?

00:11:19.303 --> 00:11:24.684
U-Uh, um... If it's not too much trouble...
C-Could I have your autograph?

00:11:24.684 --> 00:11:26.477
Hey, no fair!

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:28.479
Sure.

00:11:28.479 --> 00:11:29.522
What!?

00:11:29.522 --> 00:11:30.982
R-Really?

00:11:30.982 --> 00:11:32.817
Thank you so much!

00:11:32.817 --> 00:11:33.985
But why?

00:11:33.985 --> 00:11:37.905
I already know all about you, J's.

00:11:46.038 --> 00:11:47.665
Make yourselves at home.

00:11:47.665 --> 00:11:50.876
This is our school's cafe.

00:11:50.876 --> 00:11:52.128
Don't be shy.

00:11:52.128 --> 00:11:53.796
O-Okay.

00:11:53.796 --> 00:11:56.590
Um... I'm sorry for making such a fuss earlier.

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:58.759
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

00:12:00.636 --> 00:12:02.888
What a fabulous school.

00:12:02.888 --> 00:12:05.391
Hey! Don't act so stuck up.

00:12:06.767 --> 00:12:09.437
You're school idols, aren't you?

00:12:09.437 --> 00:12:11.188
And we're in the same region.

00:12:11.188 --> 00:12:15.109
We've been meaning to say hello,
Kosaka Honoka-san.

00:12:15.109 --> 00:12:15.609
What?

00:12:15.609 --> 00:12:19.071
When I saw you down there,
I immediately recognized you.

00:12:19.488 --> 00:12:23.367
You're far more attractive in
person than on the screen.

00:12:23.367 --> 00:12:25.661
Your power to draw people to you...

00:12:25.661 --> 00:12:28.372
Perhaps you could call it charisma.

00:12:28.372 --> 00:12:30.833
Though there are nine of you,
you still shine through.

00:12:32.001 --> 00:12:33.336
I see.

00:12:33.336 --> 00:12:38.049
We've been paying close
attention to you for a while now.

00:12:41.761 --> 00:12:47.350
Leading up to the previous Love Live, we
thought you would become our biggest rivals.

00:12:47.683 --> 00:12:48.851
N-No way.

00:12:48.851 --> 00:12:50.102
You, too.

00:12:50.561 --> 00:12:51.937
Ayase Eli.

00:12:51.937 --> 00:12:55.858
I heard you consistently ranked highly
in ballet competitions in Russia.

00:12:57.026 --> 00:13:00.821
Nishikino Maki is a talented composer.

00:13:00.821 --> 00:13:04.533
Your music matches perfectly with
Sonoda Umi's fantastic lyrics.

00:13:05.117 --> 00:13:10.956
Hoshizora Rin's energy and athleticism make
her a well-known school idol nationwide.

00:13:10.956 --> 00:13:12.666
Koizumi Hanayo's voice harmonizes

00:13:12.666 --> 00:13:16.962
impressively with the unique
voices of the other members.

00:13:16.962 --> 00:13:19.632
Tojo Nozomi compliments
the driving force of Honoka

00:13:19.632 --> 00:13:23.594
by enveloping everyone
with a calming aura.

00:13:24.387 --> 00:13:28.099
And then there's your Akiba Charisma Maid.

00:13:28.933 --> 00:13:32.353
Or should I say former maid?

00:13:35.648 --> 00:13:37.566
Finally, there's Yazawa Nico...

00:13:42.238 --> 00:13:43.948
Thanks for all the flowers!

00:13:43.948 --> 00:13:45.116
What!?

00:13:45.116 --> 00:13:47.368
You've supported us for a very long time.

00:13:47.368 --> 00:13:48.869
I really appreciate it.

00:13:49.703 --> 00:13:51.205
Um... No, actually...

00:13:51.205 --> 00:13:53.082
Nico, is that true?

00:13:53.082 --> 00:13:54.667
I had no idea.

00:13:54.667 --> 00:13:58.546
W-Well, I've been a fan since
before U's was formed...

00:13:58.546 --> 00:14:00.631
Anyway, that's not important!

00:14:00.631 --> 00:14:01.924
What's good about me?

00:14:03.467 --> 00:14:06.929
Perhaps you're the little imp
that every group needs.

00:14:08.514 --> 00:14:09.640
The imp!

00:14:10.516 --> 00:14:12.977
- I'm an imp!
- Why do you know so much about us?

00:14:12.977 --> 00:14:16.772
Not many groups have such great members.

00:14:17.106 --> 00:14:20.860
That's why we've been
watching and supporting you.

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:21.986
More than anything...

00:14:24.196 --> 00:14:25.906
...we don't want to lose to you.

00:14:34.039 --> 00:14:37.751
But you're the best in the
country. We're just—

00:14:37.751 --> 00:14:39.837
That's all in the past.

00:14:39.837 --> 00:14:46.177
We genuinely want to be the
best at making people happy.

00:14:47.303 --> 00:14:49.054
That's all.

00:14:55.478 --> 00:14:58.856
Let's both do our best.

00:14:58.856 --> 00:15:01.609
We will not lose.

00:15:08.365 --> 00:15:09.200
Um!

00:15:14.246 --> 00:15:15.456
Members of A-RISE...

00:15:21.921 --> 00:15:23.464
We won't lose, either.

00:15:28.427 --> 00:15:30.262
Thanks for today!

00:15:33.349 --> 00:15:35.226
You're interesting.

00:15:35.226 --> 00:15:36.352
What?

00:15:36.352 --> 00:15:41.732
If you haven't decided where you're singing
yet, why don't you perform at our school?

00:15:41.732 --> 00:15:42.691
What?

00:15:42.691 --> 00:15:45.361
We're building a stage on the roof.

00:15:45.861 --> 00:15:47.071
You're welcome to use it.

00:15:47.863 --> 00:15:49.823
Think it over for a day.

00:15:54.036 --> 00:15:55.120
We'll do it!

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.247
What!?

00:15:58.749 --> 00:16:02.836
The Love Live preliminaries are finally here!

00:16:05.172 --> 00:16:06.632
Wow!

00:16:06.632 --> 00:16:09.468
It's nothing like our school.

00:16:11.136 --> 00:16:12.721
You're so cute!

00:16:12.721 --> 00:16:14.139
Of course I am.

00:16:14.139 --> 00:16:15.808
Today's the day.

00:16:15.808 --> 00:16:17.560
Okay! Let's do it!

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:20.604
It looks like a lot of people
are already watching.

00:16:20.604 --> 00:16:23.524
There's nothing to worry about.

00:16:23.524 --> 00:16:25.109
Let's just focus.

00:16:25.109 --> 00:16:29.071
But, I wonder if performing with
A-RISE is the right thing to do...

00:16:29.071 --> 00:16:34.118
After deciding to perform together, we spent
the last two weeks focusing on our training.

